# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the nfcpoly host test (tests/poly/asan-go.sh, ASAN_OPTIONS/LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=...).
# nfcpoly keeps the ClassInfo of every def_class for the life of the process on purpose ("never freed: a Var that outlives
# the context still points at its class", lib/poly/nfcpoly.cpp, Impl::classes); everything a ClassInfo owns (methods, properties,
# constructors) hangs off it and is reported as an indirect leak of the same object.
leak:nfcpoly::detail::declare_class
